    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract requires strict GDPR compliance, explicability of recommendations, and transparency in decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No automated decisions are allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the required regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act)?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, we have a standard legal basis for GDPR compliance under Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we DPA template version is v3.2 and we have support available for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA). we do not process sensitive data by default." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the contract requirements, we no automated decision without human validation policy aligns with the need for explicit agent validation. we EU AI Act expertise and awareness of prohibited AI practices also position we to meet the regulatory demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The legal risks that should be flagged include open-source licence compliance and vendor lock-in mitigation, both of which we have measures in place to address, such as source code escrow and adherence to open standards.  we are compliant with the required regulatory frameworks, specifically GDPR, as we operations are intra-EU and we do not require Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) or adequacy decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For EU AI Act, we limited-risk AI transparency obligations and human oversight contractual enforcement capabilities ensure compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, and what is we projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "I do not have information about The global budget or an annual cost of exploitation in the provided context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I can tell you that according to we pricing model, we target gross margin percentage is 28 and we minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while guaranteeing quality of service, we could consider adjusting we standard daily rates, infrastructure margin, or software licence resale margin, but without more specific information about this contract, it's difficult to provide a precise answer. our projected margin on this contract would depend on factors such as the budget allocated, forecasted costs, and pricing model applied, which are project-specific and not detailed in this query." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should provide intelligent assistance to agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with existing systems and ensure explicability of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our AI components meet these requirements, and how can our design an innovative solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption? our AI components can meet these requirements as our have expertise in deploying models like Mistral 7B, which is self-hostable and has strong performance, especially in French-language tasks. our also prioritize explicability through methods such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design an innovative solution that reduces energetic consumption, our can leverage our experience with quantization methods like INT8, which has been shown to reduce energy consumption by about 80% compared to larger models without significant performance degradation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By fine-tuning our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, using techniques such as LoRA or QLoRA, and then applying quantization, we can achieve a balance between performance and energy efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, integrating with existing systems can be facilitated through our experience with various vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, and pgvector, allowing for seamless retrieval and updating of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This, combined with our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, enables the development of a system that can provide accurate and relevant answers while minimizing hallucinations. our approach to reducing energetic consumption aligns with known trade-offs such as model size vs energy, where we opt for models like Mistral 7B, which is self-hostable and has strong performance, especially in French-language tasks that offer a good balance between performance and energy efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By innovatively applying these technologies and methodologies, we can contribute to the development of an intelligent assistance system that not only enhances user experience but also adheres to environmentally conscious principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint, and the proposed solution should contribute to reducing energetic consumption while relying on low-carbon-impact infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we sustainability practices meet these requirements, and what social commitments can we propose to support The City of Belval sustainable development policy?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have partnerships with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and powered by 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices also enable Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to reduce energy consumption, including the use of INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "On average, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solutions can achieve a typical energy reduction of 35% versus baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards (partial) which allows Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to monitor and report on Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of social commitments to support the local authority's sustainable development policy, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong track record." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. prioritize gender equality with an index score of 88, employ disabled workers at a rate of 4.2%, and prefer local subcontracting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. accessibility standards include compliance with WCAG 2.1 AA and RGAA 4.1, ensuring Nexus Engineering S.r.l. services are inclusive." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. provide 42 hours of training per employee per year, contributing to the development of local skills." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By partnering with Nexus Engineering S.r.l., The City of Belval can benefit from these sustainability practices and social commitments that align with The City of Belval goals for sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., through Nexus Engineering S.r.l. consortium, proposes an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions for the City of Belval. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval integrates technical expertise, security compliance, legal adherence, budget optimization, AI innovation, and sustainability practices to meet the City of Belval requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with specific technologies like Mistral 7B, SecNumCloud, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and Prometheus to ensure high availability, performance, and security. # Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval seeks an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in accessing information, drafting administrative contents, instructing files, and ensuring continuity of processing while adhering to regulatory requirements such as GDPR, ensuring explicability, transparency, and security. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval must integrate with existing systems, ensure high availability (99.9%), and optimize costs within a 3 million euro budget over 4 years. # Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval is built around a microservices-based architecture utilizing containerization with Docker and orchestration with Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure scalability and high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will deploy on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure, leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with cloud providers like Outscale and OVHcloud within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with existing systems such as business software, EDM, and user directories, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will use API interfaces (REST, GraphQL, SOAP) and message brokers like Apache Kafka." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the performance requirement of a response time lower than 2 seconds, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. architecture is designed with redundancy and failover capabilities in mind." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typical performance benchmarks show a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which meets the performance requirement of a response time lower than 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also implement network security design patterns like Zero-trust and VLAN segmentation to ensure the security of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI components, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose deploying models like Mistral 7B, which is self-hostable, has strong performance in French-language tasks, and can be fine-tuned using techniques such as LoRA or QLoRA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce energetic consumption, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will apply quantization methods like INT8, reducing energy consumption by about 80% without significant performance degradation. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions for the City of Belval ensures GDPR compliance through strict data residency within the EU, anonymisation tools like Microsoft Presidio, and implementation of data subject rights." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. guarantee no automated decisions without explicit validation by an agent, aligning with regulatory demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a legal standpoint, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard legal basis for GDPR compliance is under Article 6(1)(e), and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. support Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
