    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should provide times of response lower than 2 seconds, guarantee high availability (99.9%), and be hosted on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose? our current technical stack can meet the integration requirements with existing systems using API interfaces, as our have experience with various API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, and API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our also have experience with message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ, which can help with integrating with business software, EDM, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of response time, our typical performance benchmarks show a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is lower than the required 2 seconds." ;
